2. ACG Digital – E2E Testing Strategy

The overall objective of E2E testing is to validate the complete Digital journey across the application and its dependent backend/integration systems.

High-Level E2E Flow

AEM
 ↓
Entry Point
 ↓
AWS Digital Environment (GA)
 ↓
Digital Application
 ↓
Quote
 ↓
Bind
 ↓
Backend / Database / Integrations
 ↓
E2E Validation

Key Point

The E2E testing will be performed in the same environment used for the relevant Digital process.

The objective is to validate that the complete journey works correctly across:

- Digital UI
- Backend systems
- Databases
- External/vendor integrations
- Business processes

