6. Early Business Validation & Early Business Testing

Two terms were discussed during the KT:

EBV – Early Business Validation

EBV refers to early validation of the Digital functionality/business flow before the complete testing cycle.

EBT – Early Business Testing

EBT refers to early testing performed to identify issues before the broader E2E execution.

Purpose

Early validation/testing helps identify:

- Functional issues
- Data issues
- Integration issues
- Environment problems
- Business-rule issues

before the full E2E cycle.

