10. Test Data Delivery Process

The notes indicate that test-data delivery previously took approximately:

4–6 weeks

However, the process has now changed.

Previous Approach

Request Data
    ↓
Data Preparation
    ↓
Wait for Data
    ↓
Testing

Updated Approach

The process has moved toward a portal-based approach, where data can be fetched based on applicable conditions.

Portal
  ↓
Specify / Meet Required Conditions
  ↓
Fetch Required Data
  ↓
Use Data for Testing

Benefit

This reduces dependency on long manual data-provisioning timelines and should improve test-data availability.

