25. Key Dependencies for E2E Testing

Successful E2E execution depends on:

Environment

- Environment available
- Correct configuration
- Required deployments completed

Data

- Test data available
- Database data available
- Vendor data available
- MVR data available where required

Integrations

- Integration services available
- Payment gateway available
- External vendors available
- Backend services available

Mobile

- Required devices available
- pCloudy access available

Business

- Test scenarios reviewed
- Expected results confirmed
- Business approval available

