26. Common E2E Risks / Challenges

Environment Issues

Environment availability can affect execution.

Test Data Issues

Incorrect or unavailable data can prevent successful E2E execution.

Vendor Dependency

External vendor data/services such as Verisk and MVR may affect testing.

Integration Issues

Failures between Digital and backend/integrated systems can impact the complete journey.

Mobile Device Availability

Required mobile devices may not always be immediately available.

Business Validation

Business review and approval are required for final E2E results.

